  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'Here you can post an ad to hire new hunters.

    - In the middle of the
    screen, you can set your settings for the hunter you prefer - the ad will prioritize
    hunters with those settings, gradually expanding to those who are further from
    the initial settings.

    - At the right part, you can toggle preferable traits
    you want hunters to have. It will gradually expand into other hunters as well
    in time.


    When a new hunter arrives during the ad campaign, you can either
    accept them into your guild or decline, if you don''t like them. Keep in mind
    that posting a new ad will require a fee and will reset the list of hunters,
    meaning you may encounter hunters you declined before.'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 6c1ea4ed2c60df14da762fe8c08aa221, type: 2}
